TI  - Deep convolutional neural network for P-band spaceborne synthetic aperture radar imaging through the ionosphere
AU  - Shi, Hongyin
AU  - Zhang, Jing
AU  - Gao, Er-Fang
AU  - Yang, Ting
AU  - Guo, Jianwen
